---
/**
 * The introduction: the greeting, and the two columns of ways to get in touch or
 * skip ahead. It takes no data — the copy is the content — so it renders itself.
 */
---

<div>
  <p class="mt-3">
    Hi,
    <br />
    <br />
    My name is <span class="text-green-900">Thom Yuill</span>.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-1">
    I am a <span class="text-green-900">designer</span> and{' '}
    <span class="text-green-900">engineer</span> and I currently work at{' '}
    <a href="https://livekit.com/" title="Day job!!" target="_blank">
      LiveKit ➚
    </a>
    .
  </p>
  <p class="mt-1 mx-auto">
    I enjoy building dynamic, interactive, accessible, and aesthetic web experiences powered with
    real-time data/media.
  </p>
</div>
<div class="flex mt-3 gap-6 ml-2">
  <div>
    <p class="mb-1">Shoot me a line on</p>
    <ul class="ml-[1ch]">
      <li class="text-green-300">
        [g]{' '}
        <a href="https://github.com/thomfoolery" title="Read the source, Luke" target="_blank">
          GitHub ➚
        </a>
      </li>
      <li class="text-green-300">
        [l]{' '}
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/thomasyuill/"
          title="Very professional"
          target="_blank"
        >
          LinkedIn ➚
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div>
    <p class="mb-1">While you're at it</p>
    <ul class="ml-[1ch]">
      <li>
        [2]{' '}
        <a href="#experience" title="Where I've been">
          browse past jobs
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        [3]{' '}
        <a href="#honors" title="Shiny things">
          gaze upon my honors
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
